OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who killed abusive partner
OL,4,Ahas murder conviction overturned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA west Belfast woman who stabbed her
OL,7,Fabusive partner to death while he slept
OL,8,Fhas had her conviction for murder
OL,9,Foverturned.
OL,11,FThe Court of Appeal ruled that jurors
OL,12,Fwere misdirected on Julie Ann
OL,13,FMcIlwaine's loss of control defence to
OL,14,Fthe killing of James Joseph Crossley in
OL,15,FMarch 2022.
OL,17,FSenior judges quashed the guilty
OL,18,Fverdict and gave the prosecution two
OL,19,Fweeks to decide if it is to seek any
OL,20,Fretrial.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
